PLACEHOLDER_GLB_FILE
=====================================
Animation: sleepy (瞌睡动画)
Type: Skeletal Animation
Format: GLB (glTF Binary)
=====================================

This is a placeholder file for the sleepy animation.

Animation Description:
- 宠物逐渐闭眼，身体微微下沉
- 呼吸变慢，偶尔打哈欠
- 眼睛半睁半闭，表现困倦状态
- 头部偶尔点头，像是要睡着

Animation Specifications:
- Duration: 4-6 seconds (loop)
- Frame Rate: 30 fps
- Bone Structure: Standard pet rig
- Loop Type: Seamless loop

Trigger Conditions:
- 用户长时间未互动 (>5分钟)
- 系统检测到夜间时间
- 用户手动触发休息模式

Implementation Notes:
- pet-animation.ts 中包含程序化的 sleepy 状态动画
- 此文件用于存放完整的骨骼动画数据
- 使用 Three.js AnimationMixer 加载和播放

